    {
      "number": 1,
      "title": "Anonymous: Add configurable device limit",
      "issue_comments": [{"body":"**Droid finished @varin-nair-factory's task** —— [View job](https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/actions/runs/21495320270)\n\n---","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:27:35Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/1#issuecomment-3820451840","id":3820451840}],
      "review_comments": [{"body":"[P1] Race condition in device limit enforcement\n\n`CreateOrUpdateDevice` checks `CountDevices` and then inserts/updates in a separate operation, which is a TOCTOU race. Under concurrency, multiple requests can all observe `count \u003c deviceLimit` and then each insert, exceeding the configured limit. This should be enforced atomically (e.g., in a transaction with appropriate locking/unique constraint-based logic) so the limit cannot be bypassed under load.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:34:48Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/1#discussion_r2743652887","id":2743652887,"line":118,"path":"pkg/services/anonymous/anonimpl/anonstore/database.go","side":"RIGHT"}],
      "reviews": [{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/1#pullrequestreview-3657874045","id":3657874045,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-13T20:44:15Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/1#pullrequestreview-3672446082","id":3672446082,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-16T19:41:16Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/1#pullrequestreview-3693844582","id":3693844582,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T18:06:55Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/1#pullrequestreview-3694117073","id":3694117073,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T19:14:15Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/1#pullrequestreview-3707976375","id":3707976375,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-26T21:00:23Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/1#pullrequestreview-3712947212","id":3712947212,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T18:58:57Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/1#pullrequestreview-3714000349","id":3714000349,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T23:57:55Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/1#pullrequestreview-3718509988","id":3718509988,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T19:00:23Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/1#pullrequestreview-3725173825","id":3725173825,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:34:48Z"},{"body":"Device limit enforcement can be bypassed under concurrent registrations because the `CountDevices` check and insert/upsert are not atomic. Consider enforcing the limit in a single transaction/constraint-backed operation to prevent exceeding the configured cap under load.","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/1#pullrequestreview-3725174201","id":3725174201,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:34:54Z"}]
    }    ,
    {
      "number": 2,
      "title": "AuthZService: improve authz caching",
      "issue_comments": [{"body":"**Droid finished @varin-nair-factory's task** —— [View job](https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/actions/runs/21495321758)\n\n---","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:27:33Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/2#issuecomment-3820451739","id":3820451739}],
      "review_comments": [{"body":"[P1] Denial cache key can mismatch user identifier formats\n\n`permDenialKey` is built from `checkReq.UserUID`, which can be either a numeric user ID string or a UID depending on how `Subject` was formatted, while the permissions cache key uses the resolved `userIdentifiers.UID`. This means a cached deny for the same user may not be found across requests that use different identifier formats, reducing cache effectiveness and making behavior inconsistent; consider resolving to `userIdentifiers.UID` before constructing the denial cache key (similar to the permission-cache path).","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:14Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/2#discussion_r2743654034","id":2743654034,"line":117,"path":"pkg/services/authz/rbac/service.go","side":"RIGHT"}],
      "reviews": [{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/2#pullrequestreview-3657879175","id":3657879175,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-13T20:45:57Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/2#pullrequestreview-3672452224","id":3672452224,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-16T19:42:58Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/2#pullrequestreview-3693836639","id":3693836639,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T18:04:35Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/2#pullrequestreview-3694111298","id":3694111298,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T19:12:40Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/2#pullrequestreview-3707972774","id":3707972774,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-26T20:59:40Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/2#pullrequestreview-3712952702","id":3712952702,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T19:00:23Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/2#pullrequestreview-3714001984","id":3714001984,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T23:58:31Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/2#pullrequestreview-3718502425","id":3718502425,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T18:59:21Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/2#pullrequestreview-3725175260","id":3725175260,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:14Z"},{"body":"Overall the caching refactor looks sound, but the new deny-cache key appears to use an un-normalized user identifier, which can lead to inconsistent deny caching across requests that identify the same user by different formats.","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/2#pullrequestreview-3725175562","id":3725175562,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:20Z"}]
    }    ,
