      "reviews": [{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/4#pullrequestreview-3657872437","id":3657872437,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-13T20:43:50Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/4#pullrequestreview-3672445498","id":3672445498,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-16T19:41:08Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/4#pullrequestreview-3693828582","id":3693828582,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T18:02:32Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/4#pullrequestreview-3694110252","id":3694110252,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T19:12:25Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/4#pullrequestreview-3707983178","id":3707983178,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-26T21:02:20Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/4#pullrequestreview-3712943869","id":3712943869,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T18:58:00Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/4#pullrequestreview-3714001319","id":3714001319,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T23:58:16Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/4#pullrequestreview-3718508885","id":3718508885,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T19:00:12Z"},{"body":"Validated both suggested issues; they rely on an incorrect assumption that `applyTemplateVariables` mutates its input. In the actual datasource implementation it returns a new query object, so this change does not mutate `request.targets` and no concrete bug was found.","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/4#pullrequestreview-3725168035","id":3725168035,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"