    {
      "number": 5,
      "title": "Notification Rule Processing Engine",
      "issue_comments": [{"body":"**Droid finished @varin-nair-factory's task** —— [View job](https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/actions/runs/21495326098)\n\n---","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:27:43Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/5#issuecomment-3820452310","id":3820452310}],
      "review_comments": [{"body":"[P1] Missing `key` prop on GrafanaRuleListItem in list rendering\n\nIn the `rules.map()` rendering switch, the `grafana` case returns `\u003cGrafanaRuleListItem ... /\u003e` without a `key` prop, while the other cases pass `key={key}`. This will trigger React key warnings and can cause incorrect reconciliation when the filtered list changes (items added/removed/reordered). Pass `key={key}` (or another stable unique key) to `GrafanaRuleListItem`.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:41:16Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/5#discussion_r2743672484","id":2743672484,"line":158,"path":"public/app/features/alerting/unified/rule-list/FilterView.tsx","side":"RIGHT"}],
      "reviews": [{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/5#pullrequestreview-3657871815","id":3657871815,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-13T20:43:41Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/5#pullrequestreview-3672448686","id":3672448686,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-16T19:41:51Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/5#pullrequestreview-3693912284","id":3693912284,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T18:25:16Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/5#pullrequestreview-3694114998","id":3694114998,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T19:13:41Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/5#pullrequestreview-3707987158","id":3707987158,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-26T21:03:34Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/5#pullrequestreview-3712953563","id":3712953563,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T19:00:37Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/5#pullrequestreview-3714001701","id":3714001701,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T23:58:23Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/5#pullrequestreview-3718516811","id":3718516811,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T19:01:22Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/5#pullrequestreview-3725197618","id":3725197618,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:41:16Z"},{"body":"The refactor to use Prometheus-backed Grafana rule data for list-view actions looks consistent. One issue to fix: the Grafana list rendering path is missing a React `key`, which will trigger warnings and can lead to incorrect reconciliation on list updates.","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/5#pullrequestreview-3725197866","id":3725197866,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:41:20Z"}]
    }    ,
    {
      "number": 6,
      "title": "Dual Storage Architecture",
      "issue_comments": [{"body":"**Droid finished @varin-nair-factory's task** —— [View job](https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/actions/runs/21495327473)\n\n---","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:27:45Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#issuecomment-3820452441","id":3820452441}],
      "review_comments": [{"body":"[P1] Create() records storage failure with legacy metrics\n\nWhen Storage.Create returns an error, the code calls `recordLegacyDuration(...)` instead of `recordStorageDuration(...)`, which will misattribute storage latency/errors to legacy metrics. Switch to `recordStorageDuration(true, ...)` on the storage failure path.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:19Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#discussion_r2743654296","id":2743654296,"line":45,"path":"pkg/apiserver/rest/dualwriter_mode3.go","side":"RIGHT"},{"body":"[P1] Delete() drops contextual logger fields when storing logger in context\n\n`klog.NewContext(ctx, d.Log)` uses the base logger rather than the enriched `log` (with name/kind/method). Downstream logs using `klog.FromContext` will miss these fields. Use `klog.NewContext(ctx, log)` instead.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:25Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#discussion_r2743654562","id":2743654562,"line":97,"path":"pkg/apiserver/rest/dualwriter_mode3.go","side":"RIGHT"},{"body":"[P1] Delete() uses object name as the \"kind\" label in metrics\n\nOn the success path, `recordStorageDuration` is passed `name` where other calls pass `options.Kind`. This creates high-cardinality metrics and inconsistent labeling. Pass `options.Kind` (or the same kind label used on the error path) instead of `name`.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:31Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#discussion_r2743654847","id":2743654847,"line":106,"path":"pkg/apiserver/rest/dualwriter_mode3.go","side":"RIGHT"},{"body":"[P1] Update() records storage failure with legacy metrics\n\nIf `Storage.Update` fails, the error path calls `recordLegacyDuration(...)` instead of `recordStorageDuration(...)`, which will corrupt latency/outcome metrics. Use `recordStorageDuration(true, ...)` for the unified-store operation failure.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:34Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#discussion_r2743655001","id":2743655001,"line":128,"path":"pkg/apiserver/rest/dualwriter_mode3.go","side":"RIGHT"},{"body":"[P1] DeleteCollection() legacy goroutine records duration to storage metrics\n\nThe goroutine measuring `Legacy.DeleteCollection` calls `recordStorageDuration(...)` (and uses `startLegacy`). This should be `recordLegacyDuration(...)` so legacy timings/errors don’t get mixed into storage metrics.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:38Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#discussion_r2743655190","id":2743655190,"line":166,"path":"pkg/apiserver/rest/dualwriter_mode3.go","side":"RIGHT"}],
      "reviews": [{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#pullrequestreview-3657868020","id":3657868020,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-13T20:42:44Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#pullrequestreview-3672448578","id":3672448578,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-16T19:41:49Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#pullrequestreview-3693842534","id":3693842534,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T18:06:20Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#pullrequestreview-3694116796","id":3694116796,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T19:14:11Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#pullrequestreview-3707977960","id":3707977960,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-26T21:00:39Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#pullrequestreview-3712947907","id":3712947907,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T18:59:09Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#pullrequestreview-3714004114","id":3714004114,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T23:59:43Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#pullrequestreview-3718505425","id":3718505425,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T18:59:45Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#pullrequestreview-3725175541","id":3725175541,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:19Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#pullrequestreview-3725175875","id":3725175875,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:25Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#pullrequestreview-3725176141","id":3725176141,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:30Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#pullrequestreview-3725176305","id":3725176305,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:34Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#pullrequestreview-3725176544","id":3725176544,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:38Z"},{"body":"Mode 3 dual-writer behavior looks correct overall, but several metrics/logging paths currently misattribute legacy vs storage durations and drop structured fields; fixing these will prevent misleading observability and high-cardinality labels.","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/6#pullrequestreview-3725176865","id":3725176865,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:43Z"}]
    }    ,
