      "title": "Database Performance Optimizations",
      "issue_comments": [{"body":"**Droid finished @varin-nair-factory's task** —— [View job](https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/actions/runs/21495328959)\n\n---","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:27:48Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#issuecomment-3820452672","id":3820452672}],
      "review_comments": [{"body":"[P1] Subtest cleanup is registered too late, risking cascading DB pollution\n\nIn `t.Run`, the test inserts rows and asserts counts before registering `t.Cleanup` to delete from `annotation`/`annotation_tag`. If a failure happens before the cleanup is registered (including leftover rows from an earlier subtest), the DB stays dirty and subsequent subtests can fail (e.g., duplicate primary keys from hardcoded IDs starting at 1). Register cleanup at the start of each subtest (or use a fresh DB per subtest) so it always runs.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:34:41Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#discussion_r2743652496","id":2743652496,"line":120,"path":"pkg/services/annotations/annotationsimpl/cleanup_test.go","side":"RIGHT"},{"body":"[P1] Cleanup logs use Error level for non-error events\n\nThe cleanup code logs normal batch progress (e.g., IDs selected for deletion and rows affected) via `r.log.Error(...)`. This will surface as errors in production and can trigger false alerts / hide real errors; these should be `Debug`/`Info` and reserve `Error` for actual failures.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:34:41Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#discussion_r2743652497","id":2743652497,"line":535,"path":"pkg/services/annotations/annotationsimpl/xorm_store.go","side":"RIGHT"},{"body":"[P2] Logging full ID lists can create very large log entries\n\nThe cleanup logs include `\"ids\", ids`, which can be thousands of integers per batch and will repeat until completion. This can bloat logs and increase CPU/IO; prefer logging only `count` (and maybe first/last ID) or guard full ID logging behind debug-only sampling.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:34:41Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#discussion_r2743652502","id":2743652502,"line":535,"path":"pkg/services/annotations/annotationsimpl/xorm_store.go","side":"RIGHT"}],
      "reviews": [{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#pullrequestreview-3657867020","id":3657867020,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-13T20:42:27Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#pullrequestreview-3672446859","id":3672446859,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-16T19:41:26Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#pullrequestreview-3693838999","id":3693838999,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T18:05:17Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#pullrequestreview-3694119176","id":3694119176,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T19:14:46Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#pullrequestreview-3707970370","id":3707970370,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-26T20:59:09Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#pullrequestreview-3712950135","id":3712950135,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T18:59:42Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#pullrequestreview-3718517923","id":3718517923,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T19:01:32Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#pullrequestreview-3725173475","id":3725173475,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:34:41Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#pullrequestreview-3725173476","id":3725173476,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:34:41Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#pullrequestreview-3725173480","id":3725173480,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:34:41Z"},{"body":"The batched cleanup approach looks fine, but the new code logs successful cleanup progress at error level and may emit extremely large ID lists when batch sizes are high. The updated integration test also registers DB cleanup after inserts, which can leave the shared test DB dirty if a subtest fails before `t.Cleanup` is registered.","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/7#pullrequestreview-3725173663","id":3725173663,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:34:45Z"}]
    }    ,
    {
      "number": 8,
      "title": "Frontend Asset Optimization",
      "issue_comments": [{"body":"**Droid finished @varin-nair-factory's task** —— [View job](https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/actions/runs/21495330972)\n\n---","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:27:55Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/8#issuecomment-3820453268","id":3820453268}],
      "review_comments": [{"body":"[P2] Missing cache re-check after acquiring write lock\n\nThe read-lock fast path releases the lock before acquiring the write lock; another goroutine can populate `entryPointAssetsCache` in between. Without re-checking under the write lock, concurrent requests in non-dev mode can redundantly recompute web assets (extra disk/CDN work) instead of returning the cached value.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:33:03Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/8#discussion_r2743647362","id":2743647362,"line":49,"path":"pkg/api/webassets/webassets.go","side":"RIGHT"}],
      "reviews": [{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3657866383","id":3657866383,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-13T20:42:14Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3672447078","id":3672447078,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-16T19:41:29Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3693829851","id":3693829851,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T18:02:48Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3694110826","id":3694110826,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T19:12:33Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3707967543","id":3707967543,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-26T20:58:22Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3712944975","id":3712944975,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T18:58:18Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3713998840","id":3713998840,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T23:57:20Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3718500179","id":3718500179,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T18:59:04Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3725166836","id":3725166836,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:33:03Z"},{"body":"The change addresses a real data race by guarding the global cache with a mutex. One follow-up is needed to avoid redundant concurrent recomputation: re-check the cache after acquiring the write lock to complete the double-checked locking pattern.","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3725167165","id":3725167165,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:33:07Z"}]
    }    ,
    {
      "number": 9,
      "title": "Advanced SQL Analytics Framework",
      "issue_comments": [{"body":"**Droid finished @varin-nair-factory's task** —— [View job](https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/actions/runs/21495332015)\n\n---","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:28:02Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/9#issuecomment-3820453881","id":3820453881}],
      "review_comments": [],
      "reviews": [{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3657870841","id":3657870841,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-13T20:43:26Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3672456942","id":3672456942,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-16T19:44:25Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3693861785","id":3693861785,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T18:11:30Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3694140213","id":3694140213,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T19:18:34Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3707979074","id":3707979074,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-26T21:00:58Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3712958580","id":3712958580,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T19:01:57Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3714008903","id":3714008903,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T00:02:15Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3718567919","id":3718567919,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T19:08:29Z"},{"body":"No candidate inline issues were validated as actionable for this diff: SQL expressions appear intentionally disabled as a security mitigation, and the stub DB code is not reachable while that gate is in place.","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3725176538","id":3725176538,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:38Z"}]
