    {
      "number": 10,
      "title": "Unified Storage Performance Optimizations",
      "issue_comments": [{"body":"**Droid finished @varin-nair-factory's task** —— [View job](https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/actions/runs/21495333629)\n\n---","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:27:58Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/10#issuecomment-3820453591","id":3820453591}],
      "review_comments": [{"body":"[P0] Concurrent index builds can corrupt file-based indexes and leak resources\n\nBy moving the lock from the start of BuildIndex to only protect the final cache write, multiple goroutines can now build the same index concurrently. The caller `getOrCreateIndex` checks `GetIndex`, and if nil, calls `build`; without a per-key guard, two goroutines can both see nil and proceed to build. For file-based indexes, both will call `bleve.New(dir, mapper)` on the same directory, which can fail or corrupt the index. When both complete, the second write to `b.cache[key]` overwrites the first, orphaning the first index without closing it (resource leak). Use per-key synchronization (e.g., singleflight or keyed mutex) so only one build per key proceeds while still allowing concurrent builds for different keys.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:51Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/10#discussion_r2743655812","id":2743655812,"line":137,"path":"pkg/storage/unified/search/bleve.go","side":"RIGHT"}],
      "reviews": [{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3657868496","id":3657868496,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-13T20:42:50Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3672447420","id":3672447420,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-16T19:41:33Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3693847758","id":3693847758,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T18:07:51Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3694119971","id":3694119971,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T19:15:00Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3707974148","id":3707974148,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-26T20:59:56Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3712954724","id":3712954724,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T19:00:56Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3714012354","id":3714012354,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T00:04:11Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3718546855","id":3718546855,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T19:05:54Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3725177273","id":3725177273,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:51Z"},{"body":"Main blocker: `bleveBackend.BuildIndex` no longer serializes builds, so concurrent requests can build the same key at once and race on the same on-disk directory (potential errors/corruption). A keyed mutex/singleflight around per-key builds would prevent duplicate builds while still allowing concurrency across different keys.","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-grafana/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3725177471","id":3725177471,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:35:55Z"}]
    }
  ]
